  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Blue Ocean Retreat, your serene escape nestled in the charming Grande Pointe neighborhood near Inlet Beach. This modern 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath home comfortably sleeps up to 10 guests and offers a laid-back coastal lifestyle with stylish interiors, two living spaces, and access to a beautiful community pool. A complimentary 6-seater golf cart and 2 adult bikes make beach days and exploring 30A a breeze.<br><br>Located just a 15-minute walk to Inlet Beach and a quick ride to the shops, dining, and activities in Rosemary, Seacrest, and Alys Beach, this retreat is perfectly situated for beach lovers and 30A explorers alike.<br><br>☼ 3 bedrooms + 2 living rooms – sleeps 10 comfortably<br>☼ Bedroom 1 (1st Floor): King primary suite with Smart TV + en-suite bathroom<br>☼ Bedroom 2 (2nd Floor): King bed with Smart TV + shared bathroom<br>☼ Bedroom 3 (2nd Floor): Bunk room with twin bed + twin-over-full bunk (sleeps 4)<br>☼ 2nd Floor Living Room: Queen-size pullout sofa + Smart TV + workspace<br>☼ Bathrooms: 2 full bathrooms + 1 half bath on main floor<br><br>The main living space boasts an open-concept design with a fully equipped kitchen, stainless appliances, a spacious dining area, and a cozy living room with Smart TV. Every bedroom and both living spaces feature Smart TVs for easy entertainment.<br><br>☼ Full-size washer & dryer on the main floor<br>☼ Covered front porch + backyard patio with outdoor dining<br>☼ Gas grill + outdoor shower for post-beach rinse offs<br>☼ Driveway parking for 2–3 vehicles<br>☼ Fast WiFi + family-friendly layout<br><br>Home Amenities:<br>☼ 6 beach chairs<br>☼ 6-seater golf cart<br>☼ 2 adult sized bikes<br><br>Closest Beach Access Point:<br>☼ Inlet Beach Regional Access<br>→ 438 South Orange Street, Inlet Beach, FL 32461<br>→ 117 parking spaces<br>→ Restrooms<br>→ ADA-accessible restrooms, boardwalk, and parking<br>→ Bike racks<br>→ Showers<br>→ Water fountain<br>→ Seasonal lifeguards<br><br>Community amenities include a resort-style pool just a short walk away, as well as nearby lake access and walking trails.<br><br>30A Beach Stays provides a few starter essentials to kick off your stay:<br>We’ve stocked the home with starter essentials:<br>☼ Full Bath: Travel Size shampoo, conditioner, hand/face bar, massage body bar, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Half Bath: Hand soap, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Kitchen: 2 dishwasher pods, 2 laundry pods, 1 sponge, small dish soap, 1 roll of paper towels<br>☼ Trash Bags: A few liners per bathroom & kitchen bins<br>If you're staying longer or need more of anything, let us know — we're happy to recommend the closest grocery or convenience stores!<br><br>Whether you're here for a beach vacation, a family gathering, or a bachelorette weekend, Blue Ocean Retreat offers the comfort, location, and style you need for an unforgettable stay on 30A.<br><br>☼ A signed rental agreement is required before check-in. This agreement only needs to be signed by the guest that booked.<br>☼ Guests ages 18–24 with no one in the group over 25 will be required to pay a security deposit.<br>☼ A golf cart agreement must also be signed before we can share the key code for the golf carts. You'll receive a link to this agreement in your check-in message.<br>☼ A $150 pet fee per pet is required for approved furry friends. This fee does not apply to service animals. Please let us know in advance if you plan to bring a pet!<br><br>For your safety, we have exterior cameras that record audio and video only when motion is detected.<br>☼ EXTERIOR USE ONLY ☼<br><br>DWE7604900<br>STR24-000960.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
