        "id": "68604cbacd43c54b378bcfe2",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We really enjoyed our stay at the proprty! The accommodations were clean, comfortable, and had everything we needed for a relaxing getaway. We especially loved having access to the golf cart—it made getting around so easy and fun. It was also a nice surprise to find beach chairs, umbrellas, and a boogie board already there for us to use. The location is great—just a short walk or quick drive to the beach. Would definitely stay here again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Wonderful Stay in Inlet Beach!",
        "verified": true
      },
